    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "For html `<div>` tag specifically you can use [`t` surrounding identifier](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-surround.txt#L184): `sa` - `ip` - `t` - `div<CR>`.\r\n\r\nFor any left and right parts use [`?` surrounding idientifier](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-surround.txt#L32): `sa` - `ip` - `?` - `left<CR>` - `right<CR>`.\r\n\r\nSee more in [this section of help](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-surround.txt#L70-L88).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">For html <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;div&gt;</code> tag specifically you can use <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-surround.txt#L184\"><code class=\"notranslate\">t</code> surrounding identifier</a>: <code class=\"notranslate\">sa</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">ip</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">t</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">div&lt;CR&gt;</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For any left and right parts use <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-surround.txt#L32\"><code class=\"notranslate\">?</code> surrounding idientifier</a>: <code class=\"notranslate\">sa</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">ip</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">?</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">left&lt;CR&gt;</code> - <code class=\"notranslate\">right&lt;CR&gt;</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See more in <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/4dd209e4f03bacd46d6d87408b2529a8823112fb/doc/mini-surround.txt#L70-L88\">this section of help</a>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "For html <div> tag specifically you can use t surrounding identifier: sa - ip - t - div<CR>.\nFor any left and right parts use ? surrounding idientifier: sa - ip - ? - left<CR> - right<CR>.\nSee more in this section of help.",
